# Optional examples only. FLINT does not auto-load this file.
# Local tests/QA need no environment variables.
# Flags override these values. Never use seed literals here.
FLINT_STORE=.flint
FLINT_SIGN_KEY=dev
# Remote operations only; the server must be configured independently:
# FLINT_REMOTE=tcp://127.0.0.1:4748
# FLINT_AUTH_KEY=.flint/auth.key
